0.
qlogin -q ve_I
cd to this directory


1.
module NECSDK/all
./run_grids
   Generates a grid

   Program: grids.F  
   Output: grid.dta.out, results_grids 
             are saved in $OUT


2.
   Edit and copy size.h to $OUT


3.
./run_topog
   Generates topography

   Program: topog.F
   Input: grid.dta.out, /S/data01/G4006/y0003/DATASET/TOPOG/ETOPO1/etopo1.dbl
   Output: kmt.dta, ht.dta
             are saved in $OUT

4.
./run_correct_kmt
   Copy kmt=0 from mine_0-360e/kmt.dta

   Program: correct_kmt.f90
   Input:  /S/data05/G4006/y0330/data/TOPOG/mine_0-360e_vh/kmt.dta.orig
           /S/data05/G4006/y0330/data/TOPOG/mine_0-360e/kmt.dta
   Output: /S/data05/G4006/y0330/data/TOPOG/mine_0-360e_vh/kmt.dta


5.
Edit kmt.dta by hand


6.
./run_read_kmt
   Generates kmt.dta.bin for grads visualization
   Edit imt and kmt in read_kmt.F before running

   Input:  kmt.dta
   Output: kmt.dta.bin

   Edit kmt.ctl. Notice kmt(imt-2,jmt-2) for output
   If Error happens, modify kmt.dta


7.
./run_topog_m
   Generates ht.dta corresponding to edited kmt.dta

   Program: topog_m.F
   Input: kmt.dta, grid.dta.out, /S/data05/G4006/y0003/DATABASE/TOPOG/ETOPO1/etopo1.dbl
   Output: ht.dta


8.
./run_read_ht
   Generates ht.dta.bin for grads visualization

   Input:  ht.dta
   Output: ht.dta.bin

   Edit ht.ctl. Notice ht(imt-2,jmt-2) for output

